GIVEN `the person making the offer` IS A Party @desc Who makes the offer?
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 241 duty action`
`s 241(11) the person making the offer must pay the applicant within 7 days from the receipt of the notification and documents` MEANS
    PARTY `the person making the offer`
    MUST `s 241(11) pay the applicant all moneys paid for the securities or contracts`
    WITHIN 7
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the person making the offer` BECAUSE "the act was not done within 7 days; the text states the time limit and no consequence of its own"

